# wfg-log 1
# fixture mic - a mic cue through its rack channel: heard, stopped, fired again, its
# plugin's child killed, and a double Esc (namespace draft 18.5 and 18.13, 2026-09-26).
#
# WHAT IT IS FOR: that a mic cue's life replays from the document and the log alone,
# with no interface and no child. The standby arm claims Vox 1 and arms on its track
# before GO - audio.armed is the audio side's word, re-injected - so GO starts the run
# at once; Esc ends it only when its tail has rung out, run.ended fourteen ticks after
# run.stopAll: the five-millisecond shut, then a quarter of a second of quiet at the
# channel's output stage. Fired again, the cue takes the channel again; its plugin's
# child dies from its own parameter and the failure says the channel is silent until
# it is back (decision CU); the relaunch two seconds on dies from the same parameter
# and stays down, saying so; and a double Esc ends the run at once. Recorded from a
# real `wfg serve --hosted --input-wav` of a copy of tests/fixtures/bundles/mic fed a
# steady level at its first input, driven over OSC by
# tests/blackbox/phase9b_mic.py --keep-log.
#
# bundle mic sha256:302b8a997a4df022ebf7df01b8d14ee86b55e40406dd34282adb042c29043e57
# clock sampleRate=48000 blockSize=128 samplesPerTick=960
A 0 0 engine audio.editBuilt s:"hosted" i:2 i:2 i:66
A 0 1 engine audio.arm s:"MC000002" s:"HX2ZFQRG"
A 1 2 engine audio.armed s:"HX2ZFQRG" i:2
A 6 3 udp:127.0.0.1:55567 go s:"HX2ZFQRG"
A 7 4 engine run.started s:"HX2ZFQRG"
A 7 5 engine node.set s:"/godot/audio/patchSettled" T
A 102 6 udp:127.0.0.1:55568 run.stopAll
A 116 7 engine run.ended s:"HX2ZFQRG"
A 202 8 udp:127.0.0.1:55570 cue.fire s:"MC000002" s:"ZX2KC9X0"
A 203 9 engine audio.armed s:"ZX2KC9X0" i:2
A 204 10 engine run.started s:"ZX2KC9X0"
A 204 11 engine run.late s:"ZX2KC9X0" i:7
A 302 12 udp:127.0.0.1:55571 node.set s:"/godot/fx/MC000005/p1" f:1
A 306 13 engine plugin.failed s:"MC000012" s:"the plugin stopped answering: 8 blocks late in a row on channel Vox 1; Vox 1 is silent until it is back; restarting in two seconds"
A 402 14 engine document.autosave
A 424 15 engine plugin.failed s:"MC000012" s:"the plugin stopped answering: 8 blocks late in a row on channel Vox 1; Vox 1 is silent until it is back; failed again inside a minute, so it stays down until plugin.restart"
A 503 16 udp:127.0.0.1:64920 run.killAll
A 505 17 engine run.ended s:"ZX2KC9X0"
